1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Same approach.
Different landing.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Could it be the smell?
Change only the coat.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Fewer landings on stripes
than black or white coats.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
They still approach.
The difference is up close.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,067
Would checks work too?
Change the pattern.

6
00:00:18,067 --> 00:00:20,000
Checks reduced
landings too!

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
High contrast worked better
than faint stripes.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Do smaller dark patches
make the difference?

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Stripes can reduce
horsefly landings.

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Why it works is still studied.
Not a perfect shield.
